Introduction to Avo Assure
Avo Assure is a no-code, AI-driven test automation platform that works with various software types and product implementation tools. It is used for innovative QA testing of business applications, covering a wide range of capabilities, from the visual layer to underlying services, and databases. It supports web, desktop, ERP, mainframes, mobile apps, and a lot more, making testing easier and efficient.

This comprehensive test automation solution is designed to help organizations of all sizes to effectively test their business applications. With its robust features, Avo Assure enables teams to create automated tests covering various aspects of their applications, ensuring higher quality and performance.

Whether the business operates in finance, healthcare, retail, or any other industry, Avo Assure provides the tools needed to streamline the testing process, reduce manual effort, and accelerate time to market.

Avo's platform vision is to revolutionize automation quality and functionality through thorough testing before any application hits the market. This direction of Avo Assure makes testing a positive and interactive experience rather than a challenge.
